Subject: MAINTAINERS: add the HiSilicon AIAO audio drivers entry

The AIAO audio block has three drivers and no maintainer entry.
The I2S port driver, the sound card and the internal DAC codec are all
DT-binding drivers under linux-sound.
Register the three drivers with their bindings in one entry.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)


